{"server":"tw","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_03_beg","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_03","title":"惡客盈門","storyCode":"PV-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8fa2d6fb4766e12cc23246a1b12ef1f15b40b429350e49f16002e2cb9df527cb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月1日    8:10 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以至於獵人的後代，都習慣了這樣挺直平整又舒適的穿著……慢慢地，它發展成了敘拉古人如今最常穿的套裝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……爺爺，這沒頭沒尾的故事，我才幾歲的時候您就在講，現在我都十幾歲了，您還在講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧奇諾，這兩套套裝已經做得差不多了，現在就剩下鈕扣沒有加上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你已經自作主張替店裡接下了訂單，不管客人是什麼身分，我們都不能馬虎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去裡屋把那幾枚特製的鈕扣取來，上面有薩盧佐的家徽，你不會認錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但按您教的規矩，我們不是應該先帶著這兩套衣服去找那位拉普蘭德小姐試衣，修改完再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，那位薩盧佐家的小姐並不需要。衣服合身與否，我會判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她下單時沒提過這個要求……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在期待什麼，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時，客人們對套裝的要求繁瑣細緻，有時卻又含糊其辭，但我們都不能多問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，盧奇諾，德蒙塔諾信譽好的原因，絕不僅僅是懂得量體裁衣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人和布料沒什麼不同，我們得自己判斷，哪些布料能碰，哪些布料碰不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去拿鈕扣吧，這單生意該結了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧奇諾看著那兩套無比華麗的禮服，它們與過往爺爺所經手的任何一套套裝都不一樣。\n無疑，那是能冠以“德蒙塔諾出品”的傑作。他多希望自己也能參與其中。\n盧奇諾下意識摸了摸自己的口袋，裡面安靜地放著幾枚他私下做好的鈕釦，上面刻著薩盧佐家的標誌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就拿過來，爺爺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您已經在門外站很久了，請進吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老翁貝托，安東尼奧先生交代的差事實在沒辦法再拖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老家主已經快到新沃爾西尼了，現在去還趕得上在狂歡節巡遊之前替他把新衣做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推掉其他所有的委託，和我去一趟威尼斯載具公司，不用太多時間的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……現在我手上的這份委託，我同樣得罪不起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺，我聽到了有客人來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老翁貝托，其實量身這種小事，也不必你親自去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，想去見見真正的大人物嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？大、大人物？爺爺，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧奇諾，先把鈕扣給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在這裡，爺爺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小裁縫緊張地盯著爺爺的臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但還達不到能用在這兩套衣服上的標準，盧奇諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但我比較了很久，它們沒什麼不同！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你縫的扣子夠多了，你也能在摸到它們的時候就知道是否適合。去拿我的鈕扣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，給你，它們都在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我、我只是想要幫上您的忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老翁貝托，要我說，你對一個孩子過於苛刻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續去做你的練習，盧奇諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，練習。等我替您取完藥回來，我會乖乖去練習的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您也看到了，這孩子還太冒失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你在消遣我，老翁貝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，先生，現在正值狂歡節，最近的訂單多到實在忙不過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向您保證，等到我手上這筆訂單結束，我會親自到府上去找那位客人道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，後續的費用也都由我來出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為安東尼奧先生會在乎這些？我也只在乎自己能安安心心過個節，老翁貝托——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"翁貝托·德蒙塔諾，你果然在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_i23"},{"type":"narration","text":"狐狸還鄉"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不應該出現在這裡，扎羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為被拔去獠牙的失敗者，你應該回到荒野，靜待下一輪遊戲開始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，凱撒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我知道，你作為本輪遊戲最有可能成為頭狼的競爭者，沒辦法不著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從你身上嗅到了濃重的人類氣息，你已經物色好了新的玩物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，為何找我？扎羅，你想從我這索求更多的安慰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你哄騙你那小狼崽子的把戲我已經看膩煩了，“外婆”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喚你來此，是為了向你分享一個有趣的秘密——最後一位尚未現身的獠牙，到底藏在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不該干涉遊戲，你在破壞規矩，出局者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但局外人恰恰最喜歡看戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱撒，你那副慈悲外表下隱藏的血腥味和舔舐勝利的渴望……你從來都瞞不過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，我也不在乎你是否願意知道這個秘密。無論如何，我都會享受這份樂趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的狼崽子嗅覺不錯，可惜本輪遊戲至今仍未現身的獠牙花費了數十年去洗清身上的狼味——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翁貝托·德蒙塔諾，一個可悲的裁縫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1549_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扎羅，我保證等到這輪遊戲結束，你會同樣享受到被我們撕咬的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱撒，你的憤怒依舊美味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":"avg_npc_688_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但可惜，我甚至不是第一頭挑戰我們規矩的狼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾珀？遊客？抱歉，德蒙塔諾的預約已經滿了，暫時不營業了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微笑的女人","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是老闆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你管我是不是——"},{"type":"narration","text":"他沒敢把話說完。\n因為他看到了對方手裡的刀。\n對了，刀，在這座城市，有多久沒看到有人這麼自然地帶著武器出門了？\n女人的嘴角還掛著笑意，但他有種感覺，再多說一個字，對方的刀就會捅穿自己的喉嚨，哪怕這是在新沃爾西尼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，女士，這位先生是威尼斯載具公司的員工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微笑的女人","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“載具公司”？看來我離開之後，家裡的變化很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沃爾珀……她臉上的疤……這身衣服，還有這把刀——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她是當年那個叛逃出家族的殺人狂……但她不是六年前就已經……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，請先回去吧，麻煩替我向安東尼奧先生致意。當然，我剛才的保證絕對有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖……你……我……*敘拉古粗口*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1555_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（謝了，翁貝托。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"英格麗女士，看起來你的變化並不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟當年你的照片在報紙上霸佔了頭條很長時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你會先把重回敘拉古的行程通知你的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經脫離威尼斯家族多年了——我是來找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你並非為殺我而來，你身上有我熟悉的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦古？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。他靠關係找到了東國，我們做了一個交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g10_easternhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定你要一邊在紅葉裡打滾曬太陽，一邊和我說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（巨大的哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不是那頭狼和我有點交情，我連話都懶得幫他帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我回到敘拉古……做一個人的保鏢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是“解決麻煩”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後你就可以知曉你一直求而不得的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼當年你殺了那麼多人，卻依然找不到傷害了你女兒的兇手。以及，那個人到底是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這真的不是你為了趕我走想的託辭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵哈，愛信不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"除了他，我應該是整個神社裡唯一一個不討厭你的了，英格麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每次看你為了見他一面，一路從外面殺進來，我還滿開心的，不然神社的日子真的有點太無聊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，我都有點想跟你回敘拉古逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一座很深的泥潭……你這樣倔強頑固又喜歡打滾的傢伙是不會喜歡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟他說一聲，我回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的獸主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不自己跟他說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗薩的事，他會理解的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到敘拉古後，我也見過了狼之主。翁貝托·德蒙塔諾，如果不是他親口向我確認，我實在難以想像他會選擇你這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這樣一個不起眼的裁縫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道瓦古如何向你提起我，但我和他在某些事情上的認知確實有些微妙的分歧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的狀態很不對勁，翁貝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按瓦古的描述，他們這些狼所選擇的人都理應在某一方面有著傲人的天賦，但你實在太虛弱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才出門去的那個孩子，就是你的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧奇諾他是個聰明的孩子，只是暫時還不能接受我們沒辦法打敗時間的事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我老了，英格麗，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦古還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒辦法評判對他們而言，什麼是好什麼是壞……不過，他沒找過你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已經許多年沒有再找過我了，我還以為他早已拋棄了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能只是不想讓你再沾染上他的味道，這對你來說安全一點。我猜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，翁貝托，你和瓦古之間的事情我沒興趣知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來替你解決麻煩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他留下了一些分辨其他獠牙的手段給我。與其等著那些人找你麻煩，我想，最快的辦法是我主動去找他們的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來他開出的條件讓你都沒辦法拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這座泥潭，一旦踏進了半隻腳，就沒那麼容易離開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>1100年11月5日    11:00 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……等一下見到了阿爾貝托先生，是不是要仔細地為他解釋這套禮服的設計？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不行，爺爺知道了一定會生氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果是阿爾貝托先生自己問起，我總不能拒絕吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能認識薩盧佐家族的家主，對德蒙塔諾來說不是壞事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣也許能幫爺爺拿到更好的藥，說不定還能帶他去哥倫比亞看更好的醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，別胡思亂想了，盧奇諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德小姐給的地址，我記得是在這個方向——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……卡車？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼開這麼快，會撞上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧奇諾抱著存放禮服的精美盒子站在街角，就這麼目睹了一場車禍的發生。\n一輛載滿貨物的卡車就這麼突然撞上了剛剛準備拐過路口的轎車。\n玻璃碎片撒滿了現場，轎車車身也已變形。一個輪胎從卡車車廂內彈了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……救、救人……對，救人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，現在大家都去主街區那邊看競演了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，車裡面的人撐住，我來想辦法救你們出來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這些是什麼……輪胎裡面還有其他東西？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，甘比諾，真的是我們盯的那輛車！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明只是喝口咖啡的工夫，怎麼……這下子全完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來只分到個打掩護的工作就已經夠倒楣了。苦勞全是我們，功勞一點撈不上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這批貨還在我們面前出了問題——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕更糟，你看看被撞的那輛轎車，是不是很眼熟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這時候你還關心他媽的誰被撞了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那是，萊昂圖索的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在得承認之前你說回龍門的打算不算糟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁警察和老闆還沒來得及反應，趕快走，我們之間的帳可以回龍門之後再慢慢算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易在這有點未來，現在絕對不能退縮，別忘了我們來新沃爾西尼投奔威尼斯載具公司的原因是什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有西西里夫人，沒有灰廳，甚至沒有其他家族的掣肘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定，我們能在這混出個自己的家族來，甘比諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到街對面那個抱著盒子的小子了嗎？現在這條路就他一個人看到了車禍，會不會他也不小心看到了卡車裡藏的其他貨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我懂你的意思了，他有沒有看到的確是我們說了算。你真是個壞傢伙，卡彭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是找條活路罷了，順便在老闆面前立個功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，把他帶回去，說我們把現場唯一的目擊者控制住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這些貨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是接貨人需要考慮的事。別忘了，老闆再三強調，我們只是打掩護的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於萊昂圖索……哼，他自求多福吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要快，不能讓那小子被其他人搶先帶走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，還有人來幫忙？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧奇諾","speakerId":"avg_4155_talr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，車裡還有人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暈過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來扛他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這小子手裡的那個箱子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起拿走，別留下任何線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定我們躲開監視器了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話，我來這裡的第一件事就是摸清周圍的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"narration","text":"“已打烊”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咖啡館裡靜悄悄的，只有門口的招牌偶爾傳來“滋滋”的電流聲。\n“歇業三天，歡迎新舊顧客為我女兒歐菲莉婭的競演投票，要是她獲得了狂歡節當晚點亮花車的資格，一週內咖啡全部免費！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"氣味，很濃烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅知道你逃到了這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅手中的匕首與閃過的箭頭擦出了火花，她的手被震得微微發麻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反應很快嘛，難怪能在我狩獵的時候撐這麼久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過你中計了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅抓住你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好痛！如果你不是獠牙，我真想邀請你也加入獸群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜阿涅塞不會同意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆還在等紅……紅必須先狩獵你……然後再去狩獵最後一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你在猶豫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，紅不再猶豫了。紅不想讓凱爾希失望，但更不想讓外婆失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可不要靠獵人太近哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"子月轉身射出一箭的同時，迅速側身撞破玻璃，來到街道上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，這一箭我絕對不會失手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在把你拖到阿涅塞面前之前，我需要確認一件事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來瓦古的確沒有騙我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狼群果然都躁動起來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到你們，可花了我不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過接下來的事，反倒簡單了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你身上有阿涅塞討厭的味道，但你不是獠牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅，你認識她嗎？放心走出來，我拉弓的手很穩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅不認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"但她的刀，比紅的鋒利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你也沒把握？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅，我們這樣可沒辦法分出勝負。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅會比你快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅色的身影迅速衝向英格麗，而子月手中的弓也迅速轉向提著刀的沃爾珀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不會比我的箭更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三支箭內，我會把她逼到角落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在你的背後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想讓我分心？嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去在敘拉古，我處理過比這更棘手的情況，同時動手的人也更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但無一例外，躺下的絕不會是我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她手中的刀鞘裡，穩穩地插著三支長箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別將人與獸群等同，你狩獵野獸的那套技巧，在我面前沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可繼續試試。當然，你也是，“紅”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"子月","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會找到你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅的刀，需要更鋒利……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒辦法躲太久的。瓦古欠我的答案，我已經等不了了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城裡的警察效率這麼高？我也得撤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車禍、獠牙、還有威尼斯家族的影子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，敘拉古果然會用更大的驚喜歡迎我回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["紅"]}]}
